234
00:06:44,119 --> 00:06:45,975
and every dramatic moment that

235
00:06:45,975 --> 00:06:47,996
followed carried real weight, because

236
00:06:47,996 --> 00:06:49,770
the audience had already watched

237
00:06:49,770 --> 00:06:50,918
the show prove, at real

238
00:06:50,918 --> 00:06:51,874
cost, that it meant

239
00:06:51,874 --> 00:06:53,214
what it was threatening.

240
00:06:54,413 --> 00:06:55,469
That is the piece that

241
00:06:55,469 --> 00:06:56,878
is hardest to manufacture on

242
00:06:56,878 --> 00:06:58,527
a compressed schedule, because

243
00:06:58,527 --> 00:06:59,999
