268
00:07:38,923 --> 00:07:42,120
Cliffhangers rationed carefully enough that

269
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,159
the audience could never

270
00:07:43,159 --> 00:07:44,198
predict exactly when the

271
00:07:44,198 --> 00:07:45,039
next one was coming.

272
00:07:45,580 --> 00:07:46,968
Stakes built slowly enough

273
00:07:46,968 --> 00:07:47,995
that a loss actually

274
00:07:47,995 --> 00:07:49,015
registered as a loss

275
00:07:49,015 --> 00:07:50,199
rather than a headline.

276
00:07:50,729 --> 00:07:51,653
None of these are

277
00:07:51,653 --> 00:07:53,171
